{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "crmliff-api-collection",
    "name": "CRM LIFF API Collection",
    "description": "Postman collection สำหรับทดสอบ CRM LIFF API โดยยึดตามการใช้งานจริงในส่วน www/ ของแอป\n\nคำแนะนำการใช้งานอย่างย่อ:\n- เริ่มจาก Health Check → Get Store Types → Verify Agent หรือ Create Sale Agent\n- อัปโหลดรูปด้วย Upload Photo (Custom) เพื่อได้ file_url สำหรับใช้กับ Create Store/Check-in\n- เมื่อสร้างร้านแล้ว ระบบจะบันทึกตัวแปร store_id ไว้ให้อัตโนมัติ ใช้กับ Check-in และ Store Detail/History ได้\n\nตัวแปรที่ใช้:\n- base_url: URL ของ Frappe site เช่น http://crmliff.localhost\n- file_url: ค่า URL รูปจาก Upload Photo (บันทึกใน Tests)\n- store_id: เลือกร้านล่าสุด (บันทึกใน Tests ของ Create Store)\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health Check",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/method/crmliff.api.liff_api.health_check",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "method", "crmliff.api.liff_api.health_check"]
        },
        "description": "ตรวจสอบสถานะ API ตามที่ www ใช้ ก่อนทำงานอื่นๆ"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Get Store Types",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/method/crmliff.api.liff_api.get_store_types",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "method", "crmliff.api.liff_api.get_store_types"]
        },
        "description": "ดึงรายการประเภทร้าน ใช้แสดงตัวเลือกใน liff-app และ store-detail"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Verify Agent (GET)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const json = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test(\"Has message wrapper\", () => pm.expect(json).to.have.property('message'));"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/method/crmliff.api.liff_api.verify_agent?agent_code=S001",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "method", "crmliff.api.liff_api.verify_agent"],
          "query": [
            {"key": "agent_code", "value": "S001"}
          ]
        },
        "description": "ตรวจสอบรหัสพนักงาน (ใน www เรียกแบบ GET)\n- กรอก agent_code เช่น S001\n- ผลลัพธ์ใช้เพื่อยืนยันก่อนสร้าง/เช็คอิน หรือแมป LINE UID (หน้า dev-tools)"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Create Sale Agent",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const json = pm.response.json();",
              "if (json.message && json.message.success) {",
              "  pm.globals.set('agent_name_doc', json.message.data.name);",
              "}",
              "pm.test(\"Created\", () => pm.expect(json.message).to.have.property('success'));"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"agent_code\": \"S001\",\n  \"agent_name\": \"สมชาย ใจดี\",\n  \"territory\": \"Bangkok\",\n  \"line_uid\": \"\",\n  \"is_active\": 1\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/method/crmliff.api.liff_api.create_sale_agent",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "method", "crmliff.api.liff_api.create_sale_agent"]
        },
        "description": "สร้างพนักงานเซลส์ใหม่ (ใช้ทดสอบหรือเตรียมข้อมูล)\n- www ไม่ได้เรียก endpoint นี้ตรงๆ แต่มีประโยชน์ตอนตั้งค่าข้อมูลเริ่มต้น"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Upload Photo (Custom)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const json = pm.response.json();",
              "const url = json.file_url || (json.message && json.message.file_url);",
              "if (url) pm.globals.set('file_url', url);",
              "pm.test(\"file_url exists\", () => pm.expect(url).to.be.a('string'));"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {"key": "Accept", "value": "application/json"}
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "formdata",
          "formdata": [
            {"key": "file", "type": "file", "src": ""}
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/method/crmliff.api.liff_api.upload_photo",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "method", "crmliff.api.liff_api.upload_photo"]
        },
        "description": "อัปโหลดรูปภาพแบบเดียวกับ www (มี fallback จาก upload_file)\n- แนบไฟล์ใน form-data key=\"file\"\n- เมื่อสำเร็จ จะบันทึกตัวแปร file_url ให้อัตโนมัติ ใช้กับ create/check-in"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Create Store",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const json = pm.response.json();",
              "if (json.message && json.message.success) {",
              "  pm.globals.set('visit_id', json.message.data.visit_id);",
              "  pm.globals.set('store_id', json.message.data.store_id);",
              "}",
              "pm.test(\"Created store_id\", () => pm.expect(pm.globals.get('store_id')).to.be.ok);"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"agent_code\": \"S001\",\n  \"location_lat\": 13.7563,\n  \"location_lng\": 100.5018,\n  \"address\": \"123 Test Street, Bangkok\",\n  \"store_type\": \"FOOD\",\n  \"store_name\": \"ร้านทดสอบจาก Postman\",\n  \"store_description\": \"สร้างร้านพร้อมรูปจาก file_url\",\n  \"contact_name\": \"คุณทดสอบ\",\n  \"contact_phone\": \"+66812345678\",\n  \"cover_image\": \"{{file_url}}\",\n  \"photos\": [ { \"image\": \"{{file_url}}\", \"caption\": \"รูปหน้าร้าน\" } ]\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/method/crmliff.api.liff_api.create_store",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "method", "crmliff.api.liff_api.create_store"]
        },
        "description": "สร้างร้านใหม่ตาม flow ใน liff-app\n- แนะนำให้อัปโหลดรูปก่อน (Upload Photo) เพื่อมี {{file_url}} ใช้เป็น cover_image/photos\n- เมื่อสำเร็จ จะบันทึก store_id, visit_id อัตโนมัติ"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Check-in Store",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "if (!pm.globals.get('store_id')) { console.warn('No store_id. Run Create Store first.'); }",
              "if (!pm.globals.get('file_url')) { console.warn('No file_url. Run Upload Photo first.'); }"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const json = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test(\"Checkin ok\", () => pm.expect(json).to.have.property('message'));"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"agent_code\": \"S001\",\n  \"store_id\": \"{{store_id}}\",\n  \"location_lat\": 13.7565,\n  \"location_lng\": 100.5020,\n  \"remark\": \"เช็คอินจาก Postman\",\n  \"photos\": [ { \"image\": \"{{file_url}}\", \"caption\": \"การเช็คอิน\" } ]\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/method/crmliff.api.liff_api.checkin_store",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "method", "crmliff.api.liff_api.checkin_store"]
        },
        "description": "เช็คอินร้านแบบเดียวกับ list-store/store-detail\n- ต้องมี store_id (จาก Create Store) และรูป (จาก Upload Photo)"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Get Agent Stores",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/method/crmliff.api.liff_api.get_agent_stores?agent_code=S001",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "method", "crmliff.api.liff_api.get_agent_stores"],
          "query": [
            {"key": "agent_code", "value": "S001"}
          ]
        },
        "description": "ดึงรายการร้านของ agent ตามที่หน้า list-store ใช้\nหมายเหตุ: ที่ฝั่ง www ส่งค่าเป็นชื่อเอกสาร (DocName) ของ Agent ไม่ใช่ agent_code เสมอไป\n- ถ้า Verify Agent คืนค่า data.name ให้ลองใช้ค่านั้นแทน S001"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Get Store Detail",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/method/crmliff.api.liff_api.get_store_detail?store_id={{store_id}}",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "method", "crmliff.api.liff_api.get_store_detail"],
          "query": [
            {"key": "store_id", "value": "{{store_id}}"}
          ]
        },
        "description": "รายละเอียดร้าน ตามที่หน้า store-detail ใช้"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Get Store Checkin History",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/method/crmliff.api.liff_api.get_store_checkin_history?store_id={{store_id}}",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "method", "crmliff.api.liff_api.get_store_checkin_history"],
          "query": [
            {"key": "store_id", "value": "{{store_id}}"}
          ]
        },
        "description": "ประวัติการเช็คอิน (timeline) ตามที่หน้า store-detail ใช้"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Update Store",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"store_id\": \"{{store_id}}\",\n  \"store_name\": \"ชื่อร้านที่อัปเดตจาก Postman\",\n  \"store_description\": \"คำอธิบายที่อัปเดต\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/method/crmliff.api.liff_api.update_store",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "method", "crmliff.api.liff_api.update_store"]
        },
        "description": "อัปเดตร้าน ตามที่หน้า store-detail ใช้"
      },
      "response": []
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {"key": "base_url", "value": "http://crmliff.localhost", "type": "string"}
  ]
}

{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "crmliff-api-collection",
		"name": "CRM LIFF API Collection",
		"description": "Complete API collection for CRM LIFF application with LINE integration.\n\n🚀 **NEW FEATURES:**\n• Separate APIs for creating stores and checking in\n• Enhanced response validation\n• Base64 image support\n\n📋 **TESTING ORDER:**\n1. Health Check\n2. Get Store Types\n3. Verify Agent\n4. Create Store (saves store_id to globals)\n5. Check-in Store (uses saved store_id)\n6. Get Agent Stores\n\n⚙️ **SETUP:**\nSet base_url variable to your Frappe site URL (e.g., http://crmliff.localhost)",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Health Check",
			"event": [
				{
					"listen": "test",
					"script": {
						"exec": [
							"pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
							"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
							"});",
							"",
							"pm.test(\"Response has success field\", function () {",
							"    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
							"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('success');",
							"    pm.expect(jsonData.success).to.be.true;",
							"});"
						],
						"type": "text/javascript"
					}
				}
			],
			"request": {
				"method": "GET",
				"header": [],
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/method/crmliff.api.liff_api.health_check",
					"host": [
						"{{base_url}}"
					],
					"path": [
						"api",
						"method",
						"crmliff.api.liff_api.health_check"
					]
				}
			},
			"response": []
		},
		{
			"name": "Get Store Types",
			"event": [
				{
					"listen": "test",
					"script": {
						"exec": [
							"pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
							"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
							"});",
							"",
							"pm.test(\"Response has store types data\", function () {",
							"    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
							"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('success');",
							"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('data');",
							"    pm.expect(jsonData.data).to.be.an('array');",
							"});"
						],
						"type": "text/javascript"
					}
				}
			],
			"request": {
				"method": "GET",
				"header": [],
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/method/crmliff.api.liff_api.get_store_types",
					"host": [
						"{{base_url}}"
					],
					"path": [
						"api",
						"method",
						"crmliff.api.liff_api.get_store_types"
					]
				}
			},
			"response": []
		},
		{
			"name": "Verify Agent S001",
			"event": [
				{
					"listen": "test",
					"script": {
						"exec": [
							"pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
							"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
							"});",
							"",
							"pm.test(\"Agent verification successful\", function () {",
							"    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
							"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('success');",
							"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('data');",
							"});"
						],
						"type": "text/javascript"
					}
				}
			],
			"request": {
				"method": "POST",
				"header": [
					{
						"key": "Content-Type",
						"value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
					}
				],
				"body": {
					"mode": "urlencoded",
					"urlencoded": [
						{
							"key": "agent_code",
							"value": "S001",
							"type": "text"
						}
					]
				},
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/method/crmliff.api.liff_api.verify_agent",
					"host": [
						"{{base_url}}"
					],
					"path": [
						"api",
						"method",
						"crmliff.api.liff_api.verify_agent"
					]
				}
			},
			"response": []
